 "synopsis": "Business-to-business ecommerce company JSW One Platforms plans to file draft papers with the Securities and Exchange Board of India for a Rs 3,000-crore initial public offering within the next two to three weeks. Through the public issue, the JSW Group company is expected to raise Rs 1,300-1,500 crore in fresh capital. Backed by JSW Steel and JSW Cement, the company is targeting a listing in the first quarter of the next fiscal year 2028.",
